** Poke team builder requirements **

- Display a list of pokemon 
    - Pokedex from each generation or by game
- Show a pokemon weaknesses, resistances and immunities
    - Show teams weaknesses, resistances and immunities
- Show pokeon base stats    
- Select 6 unique pokemon for a team
- Choose 1 item for any pokemon to carry
    - Display a list of items
- Select pokemon abilities
    - Display a list of abilities
- Save pokemon team to account
- Display moves a pokemon can learn
    - Display a list of moves
- Select a moveset for each pokemon
- Show location of pokemon in game

